Yes. That's what most people do it for.

> and what if you get crowned before the change? 

You'll be the lawful (or chaotic, as the case may be) Envoy of Balance. Or
if you start out lawful, the neutral or chaotic Hand of Elbereth. That
is, the title and the effects don't change.

Just take care not to change alignment before you've completed the Quest;
doing that makes the game unwinnable because your quest leader won't
allow you to descend.

